  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: PAYLINE
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: WILD X2
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: 'Substitutes for all symbols

      except         .


      If less than 3 Wild X2 are part of any win combination, each Wild X2 doubles
      up the line pay.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 3         anywhere on reels triggers <color=yellow>Money Trail Bonus</color>.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_2
    value: MIXED BARS
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD SPIN FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>WHEEL BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32>MIGHTY WHEELS BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "- Appears on reel 2 only.\n- Can substitute for all symbols except Bonus
      Symbol.\n- Wild <color=yellow><b>on a pay-line</b></color> of reel 2 triggers
      \u201CWild Spin\u201D Feature that may award a multiplier up to x10 for the
      current win."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '- 3 Bonus symbols <color=yellow><b>on a pay-line</b></color> triggers
      <b><color=yellow>Wheel Bonus.</color></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '- When             lands <color=yellow><b>on a pay-line of reel 2</b></color>,
      Wild Spin Feature is activated for the current spin.

      - Multiplier reel starts spinning and may reward a multiplier up to x10.

      - Multiplier will be applied to the current spin.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '- 3               <color=yellow><b>on a pay-line</color></b> triggers
      Wheel Bonus.

      - Player can win Coin Prize from the Wheel in the middle with 2 Wheels on the
      sides locked.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: '- In any spin,             can appear anywhere on reels as a Sub-Symbol.

      - Collection of 10 Sub-Symbols triggers Mighty Wheels Bonus.

      - With 2 more unlocked Wheels, player can win Free Games as well as a multiplier
      for the Coin Prize.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: <b><size=35>1 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>
